{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_lmars_ustar",
    "description": "Chen (2021) LMARS interface solve, Eq 11: the normal velocity at the interface, u* = 1/2(uE+uW) - (piW-piE)/(2a): a centered average plus the pressure-driven acoustic correction. Reduces to the arithmetic mean when the two reconstructed pressures agree. AXIS- AND DIRECTION-NEUTRAL scalar algebra taking the four reconstructed states at one cell interface -- the EAST value of the left cell (uE, piE, from duo_recon_*) and the WEST value of the right cell (uW, piW) -- so a y-interface reuses it verbatim with the North/South reconstructions bound in. Pi = G h is the pressure forcing (kept distinct from the transported depth h, which is chosen by upwinding). Semi-discrete: the ODE integrator owns dt.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:riemann",
      "order:2",
      "scheme:lmars"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280. (Section 3.2 Eqs 11-13 LMARS interface solve; Section 3.3 Eqs 20-22 the L97-compatible averaging/viscous split.)",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X., Andronova, N., Van Leer, B., Penner, J. E., Boyd, J. P., Jablonowski, C., & Lin, S.-J. (2013). A control-volume model of the compressible Euler equations with a vertical Lagrangian coordinate. Monthly Weather Review, 141(7), 2526-2544. (Origin of the Low Mach number Approximate Riemann Solver.)",
        "doi": "10.1175/MWR-D-12-00129.1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "./duo_lmars_a.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "duo_lmars_ustar": {
      "params": [
        "uE",
        "uW",
        "piE",
        "piW"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  2
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "uE",
                  "uW"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "piE",
                  "piW"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2,
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "duo_lmars_a",
                    "bindings": {
                      "piE": "piE",
                      "piW": "piW"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
